# GitHub accounts for this repo

Remote: `https://github.com/grandmarecipe/grandma-recipe.git`

## Accounts

| Account | Role |
|---------|------|
| `grandmarecipe` | **Owner** of the repo. Use this for `git push` / `gh` when write access is needed. |
| `dadofseo` | Collaborator (write invite sent). Prefer switching to this after the invite is accepted. |
| `grapheinoservices-star` | Secondary logged-in account; pull only unless later granted write. |

## Agent rules

1. Before pushing to `main`, make sure `gh` is authenticated as `grandmarecipe` (or `dadofseo` after write access is active).
2. If push returns 403, run `gh auth switch --user grandmarecipe` (or refresh login), then retry. Do not keep retrying with `dadofseo` / `grapheinoservices-star` when they lack push.
3. Never store passwords or PATs in the repo. Only account names and roles belong in this rule.
4. Keep multiple accounts logged in via `gh auth login` / `gh auth switch`; do not log out `grandmarecipe` just to clean up.
